    description: "LLM assessment finding from ZK cohort bakeoff (5/5 repos affected). Name-only disambiguation causes 0.566 confidence edges that are mostly false positives. Example: coeff.double() where coeff: F resolves to AllocatedPoint::double instead of ff::Field::double. The receiver type is available from the AST — adding type context to method name lookup would fix the dominant source of call edge noise (~15% of all call edges in Nova). See reflect/cohort-001/iter-001/summary.yaml in deep-20260301-zk-cohort."  # 750e
